<title>FRANCE: TENNIS-WOMEN'S PARIS OPEN RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-WOMEN'S PARIS OPEN RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second round results in the</p>
<p>$450.000 Paris Open women's tennis tournament on Thursday</p>
<p>(prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Yayuk Basuki (Indonesia) beat 7-Brenda Schultz-McCarthy</p>
<p>(Netherlands) 6-4 3-6 6-2</p>
<p>2-Jana Novotna (Czech Republic) beat Kristie Boogert</p>
<p>(Netherlands) 6-2 6-4</p>
<p>3-Anke Huber (Germany) beat Sabine Appelmans (Belgium) 6-3 6-2</p>
<p>8-Mary Pierce (France) bat Adriana Gersi (Czech Republic)</p>
<p>walkover</p>
<p>Nathalie Tauziat (France) beat 6-Karina Habsudova (Slovakia)</p>
<p>6-4 7-6 (7-1)</p>
<p>5-Irina Spirlea (Romania) beat Chanda Rubin (U.S) 6-3 6-4</p>
</text>
